---
title: "Keep unmatched rows in a left join"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Left row 1, match right rows
  s1: Left row 1, finish left row
  s2: Left row 2, match right rows
  s3: Left row 2, finish left row
  s4: Both left rows returned
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Return matching pair
  s1 --> s2: Advance to next left row
  s2 --> s3: No right row matches
  s3 --> s4: Return unmatched row with nulls
